      "side": 1,
      "message": "We need to change RFCOMM here too: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/stack/rfcomm/rfc_mx_fsm.cc;l\u003d574;drc\u003da04fe6afd7436798064d3a0b21a5c7d973295d22;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1\n\nSince it uses L2CAP_CONN_OTHER_ERROR explicitly.\n\nIt might be nice to do something like what Myles suggested, to distinguish between L2CAP errors, and other errors  (maybe with a std::variant?).",
