      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not use the ones below?\n\nAs long as we can do it, it would be nice to have\n\nL2CAP_CONN_INSUFFICIENT_AUTHENTICATION \u003d\u003d L2CAP_LE_RESULT_INSUFFICIENT_AUTHENTICATION",
