      "writtenOn": "2023-02-08T16:55:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ideally we would have preferred to use it but we want to send codes only of one type upwards to the GAP callback. \n\nIn an ideal world I would ideally have preferred to cover these result codes across a single type if possible to avoid conflicts but I am avoiding any major changes and touching codes in non L2CAP CoC related stuff.",
