      "writtenOn": "2023-02-08T19:36:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can agree that it isn\u0027t the cleanest solution. Infact using a mask might actually be a much cleaner way to go about it and add sense to the conversion logic as well. Thanks for the idea.\n\nDid an implementation. Can you take a look?",
